{"code":0,"msg":"succ","request_id":"739882e3f67b4c6380f5375e4bf32bf3","data":{"errmsg":"success","content_id":"5cad78a6ae87fa4850aa1ccabf8c9e5f7c50","content_type":1,"content_url":"https:///resource/web/app/feeds/detail.html?id=5cad78a6ae87fa4850aa1ccabf8c9e5f7c50","view_num":687,"pub_timestamp":"1669246200","title":"HIGHTECH TOY 스토리 이벤트 소개","share_url":"https:///resource/web/app/landpage/?id=5cad78a6ae87fa4850aa1ccabf8c9e5f7c50","content":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e이벤트 진행 기간:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e2022년 11월 24일 점검 완료 이후 ~ 2022년 12월 8일 4:59:59 (UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"2\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e보상 교환 기간:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e2022년 11월 24일 점검 완료 이후 ~ 2022년 12월 8일 6:59:59 (UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"3\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e참여 조건 \u0026amp; 방식 안내\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e참여 조건: 메인 스테이지 1-4를 클리어한 모든 유저 참여 가능.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e참여 방식: 로비 화면 \u0026rarr; 이벤트 \u0026rarr; HIGHTECH TOY 배너를 터치하여 진입.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"4\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e이벤트 룰 설명\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-1.6em pap-hanging-indent-1.6em\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e이벤트 스테이지(수정)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-3.2em\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e＊이벤트 화면으로 진입하여 이벤트 전용 스테이지 및 시나리오를 경험하실 수 있습니다. 특정 이벤트 아이템 [히어로 건전지]를 소모하여 스테이지 클리어 후 스테이지 보상을 획득하실 수 있습니다. 스테이지 보상 중 [히어로 다이스]를 획득하여 미니게임 [히어로 로드]를 플레이 하실 수 있습니다. [히어로 다이스]는 반복 스테이지 플레이를 통해 획득할 수 있으며, 보너스 보상 니케를 편성하여 추가 획득이 가능합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-3.2em\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e＊이벤트 스테이지는 노멀 모드와 하드 모드로 나누어집니다. 노멀 모드는 11월 24일 점검 직후에 개방됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-3.2em\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e＊이벤트에는 스토리 스테이지와 반복 스테이지가 있습니다. 이벤트 아이템 [히어로 건전지]를 소모하여 스토리 스테이지는 1회, 반복 스테이지는 거듭하여 진입할 수 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-3.2em\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"2\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-1.6em pap-hanging-indent-1.6em\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e스테이지 참여 방식\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-3.2em\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e이벤트 아이템 [히어로 건전지] 1개를 소모하여 스테이지를 1회 클리어하실 수 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-3.2em\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e[히어로 건전지]는 매일 5:00:00 (UTC+9)에 최대 5개까지 자연적으로 보충됩니다. 만약 이를 초과하는 경우엔 더 이상 보충되지 않습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-3.2em\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e또한, [히어로 건전지]는 이벤트 상점에서 쥬얼을 소모하여 교환하실 수도 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-3.2em\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"3\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-1.6em pap-hanging-indent-1.6em\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e이벤트 아이템\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-3.2em\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eHIGHTECH TOY 이벤트 아이템인 [히어로 다이스]는 미니게임 [히어로 로드]에 사용하실 수 있습니다. [히어로 다이스]를 사용하여 나온 눈금 수만큼 라플라스가 칸을 이동하고 라플라스가 도착한 칸에 지정된 이벤트에 따라 각종 보상을 획득할 수 있습니다. [히어로 다이스]의 획득처는 다음과 같습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-3.2em\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e＊스테이지 클리어 후, 이벤트 미션을 통해 [히어로 다이스]를 획득하실 수 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-3.2em\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e＊특정 캐릭터를 사용하여 스테이지를 클리어할 경우, 일정 확률로 [히어로 다이스]*50을 획득할 수 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-3.2em\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e＊ [히어로 다이스] 획득 가능 캐릭터:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e- 라플라스: 60%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e- 맥스웰: 40%\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e- 드레이크: 40%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e- 볼륨: 30%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e- 엠마: 30%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e- 디젤: 30%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e- 라피: 20%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e- 아니스: 20%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e- 네온: 20%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e위의 캐릭터들 다수를 하나의 스쿼드로 구성한다면 획득 확률이 누적 계산됩니다. 누적\u0026nbsp;계산\u0026nbsp;확률의\u0026nbsp;상한선은\u0026nbsp;100%입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e＊반복 플레이 가능한 스테이지 보상은 다음과 같습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eNormal Stage：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e[1-2] 히어로 다이스x 10; 크레디트x 1시간\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e[1-4] 히어로 다이스x 20; 배틀 데이터 셋x 1시간\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e[1-6] 히어로 다이스x 30; 크레디트x 2시간\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e[1-9] 히어로 다이스x 40; 배틀 데이터 셋x 2시간\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e[1-11] 히어로 다이스x 50 ; 코어 더스트x 2시간\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eHard Stage：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt pap-left-indent-57pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: 